claim.claim-text:
a housing (116, 201);
an electrical power source (110, 210) within the housing;
a control component (106, 206) within the housing;
a haptic feed back component (101, 220) within the housing; and
a haptic driver (222);
wherein the haptic driver (222) is in electrical communication with the control component (106, 206) and the haptic feedback component (101, 220) such that the control component (106, 206) and the haptic driver (222) direct the haptic feedback component (101, 220) to generate one or more different waveforms defining haptic feedback to a user.

the vibrating haptic actuator comprises a linear resonant actuator (LRA);
the vibrating haptic actuator is adapted for electroactive polymer actuation;
the vibrating haptic actuator is adapted for piezoelectric actuation;
the vibrating haptic actuator is adapted for electrostatic actuation;
the vibrating haptic actuator is adapted for audio wave actuation;
the vibrating haptic actuator is a vibration transducer.
